id: searx-published-consumer-isolation
title: Verify published consumers outside the source checkout
description: Eliminate global executable leakage from published release verification and prove the requested immutable package exposes the newly shipped CLI contract.
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 0
tags[9]: bun,npm,package-contract,recovery,registry-propagation,regression,release,release-reliability,toon-v4
created_at: "2026-07-21T18:34:27.322Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-27T23:00:24.688Z"
deadline: "2026-07-28T22:25:59.682Z"
assignee: codex-searxng-agent
claim_principal: codex-searxng-agent
author: codex-release-agent
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: "Release workflow delegates exact-version registry readiness and consumer execution to the tested verification script; npm registry propagation is bounded and retry-safe; package bin metadata publishes without npm correction warnings; TOON v4 encode/decode output remains validated and default; repo-local pm-cli equals the latest installed/registry version; all 100/100/100/100, quality, security, package, live LAN, and release gates pass; scheduled recovery and exact-head GitHub checks succeed"
definition_of_ready: The exact commands pass from an unrelated directory and fail only from the package source checkout.
parent: searx-repo-health-2026
reviewer: github-bots
risk: high
confidence: 100
sprint: 2026-07-release-reliability
release: 2026.7.28
reporter: codex-release-agent
severity: critical
environment: Post-publication npm and Bun consumer verification
repro_steps: "Install searxng-cli globally at an older build that reports the same calendar version, then run npm exec --package searxng-cli@2026.7.27 -- searxng instance source-status from the repository. npm exec resolves the global binary and reports unknown resource although the registry tarball contains the command."
resolution: "Hardened daily release recovery with bounded npm propagation, normalized executable metadata, exact-line npx/bunx validation, direct regression coverage, TOON v4, and current PM tooling."
expected_result: "The release verifier installs the immutable requested artifact into separate npm and Bun roots, proves each shim is contained, executes with installation disabled, and validates exact version plus source-status help before release success."
actual_result: "Clean committed head passes all five linked acceptance commands: 949 tests at exact 100/100/100/100, calendar release policy, 10 release-contract tests, isolated npm and Bun verification of immutable 2026.7.27, and package inspection. Exact-head hosted review and merge remain pending."
affected_version: 2026.7.27
fixed_version: 2026.7.28
component: release
regression: true
customer_impact: Release verification can report success while exercising a stale global executable rather than the published artifact.
