body: "Canonical continuation of the existing published-consumer isolation item after scheduled run 29894239662 exposed a registry propagation race immediately after npm publish. The same log showed npm normalizing leading-dot bin paths during publication. This delivery reuses the existing release/feature-parity lineage, upgrades TOON to current spec v4 and repo-local pm-cli to the installed latest, and proves exact-version npm/Bun consumers, real executable bins, full local quality, and LAN SearXNG behavior."
